   "meta": {
    "application": "BambuStudio-02.00.03.54",
    "profile_title": "Tray & Washer accessories, 0.2mm layer, 2 walls, 15% infill",
    "profile_notes": "Two additions to this fantastic game that I found useful. TPU washer to add to the locking plug to give it a better feel on tightening. A tray insert to hold the dice and 50 pigs, helps keep track of the pigs so that it is obvious when any go missing, sorry couldn't fit 64 pigs but this allows for 5 players with 10 pigs each and segmented into groups of 10 (useful for young players that may not count reliably). Secure the tray to the base with double sided tape.",
