   "meta": {
    "application": "BambuStudio-02.01.01.52",
    "profile_title": "Corrales para cerdos - A1 mini",
    "profile_notes": "0.4mm nozzle, 0.2mm layers, 2 walls, 15% grid infill, includes modifiers for honeycomb floor, no supports. Printed in Bambu PLA Basic - Black. I have reduced the original one, It is compatible with the A1 mini printer, can be printed on that printer, and fits perfectly with the box printed on the model made for the A1 mini. Great model and great game! The family kept knocking the little squealers all over the place during gameplay so I created some Pig Pens to keep them under control during the game (pens for the pigs, not for the kids - not yet anyways!). The pens hold your pigs during the game and are stored in the original designer's game box with no modifications. There are 6 pens in all, 5 outer pens which are all identical, and 1 inner pen. The inner pen has a cover plate to be put in place (from the inside of the pen) when taken out of the box and removed again when storing the pens in the box. The pen floors are mesh honeycomb for easy clean-up! The model print profiles include modifiers that eliminate the top and bottom surfaces to create the open honeycomb floor. The build plate for the outer pig pens has all 5 pens; if for some reason you need to print fewer than 5, be sure to include the corresponding modifier with its pen to get the honeycomb floor. The second build plate has the inner pen and cover plate, each with their own modifiers. Thanks again to KR_Design for sharing the original game.",
    "creation_date": "2025-08-07",
    "slicer": "Bambu Studio",
    "printer": "Bambu Lab A1 mini",
